{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>粉嶺靈山村今日（29日）凌晨發生火警，一名男子被發現倒斃現場，身份有待警方查證。現時消防員仍然在場調查，初步懷疑火警起因與電線有關。有居民凌晨時份，聽到有人嗌火燭驚醒，匆忙執拾細軟走火警，幸沒有受傷。</p><figure><img alt=\"消防員在場射水灌救。（讀者提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159055510792572928609735.jpeg/nUrUKPAcZ3ABkIMga2ZnT-9eVRO9HF7PTn5CA05-QgM\"/><figcaption>消防員在場射水灌救。（讀者提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防員在場射水灌救。（讀者提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159055513049239552684157.jpeg/DXBGblgAVX-vHqVzZBzupx947KB9VGYz9jSVxfY0lcU\"/><figcaption>消防員在場射水灌救。（讀者提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"有村民走火警。（讀者提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159055515222020096750386.jpeg/CLSi5IT2mXsJC7Sk_f2ss1G-heRx92prn8BqhJ_AaoQ\"/><figcaption>有村民走火警。（讀者提供）</figcaption></figure><p>由居民提供的片段可見，現場鐵皮屋一片通紅，消防員入村拖喉射水。</p><p>居民陳先生說：「聽到出面有人喺度嗌，4點40分左右就疏散咗出嚟；唔認識嗰間屋啲人，亦都唔知道係咩事着火。」他執拾少量衣物和證件匆匆離開。</p><figure><img alt=\"陳先生收拾細軟匆匆離開。（陳巧恩攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159056717804212224748359.jpeg/oh2p2Q8GqMXGCFfwPftJdFf51ZxJ9YJemXdmcLN3ZnA\"/><figcaption>陳先生收拾細軟匆匆離開。（陳巧恩攝）</figcaption></figure><p>另一位居民彭太，與丈夫及95歲家姑逃出單位。她表示與起火單位有一段距離，得悉火警後丈夫連忙用輪椅協助家姑離開，她則帶着大包小包的衣物逃去。</p><figure><img alt=\"彭太與丈夫和家姑逃出。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159066459280773120293506.jpeg/QzKTKEK_m5CWKsCXb8IbwqI0SiJ8lJwnCDKFKC0yhSg\"/><figcaption>彭太與丈夫和家姑逃出。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"彭老太95歲，由兒子推輪椅走火警。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159066462976086016685974.jpeg/UlSwDGhkKev8CZLYWa_HQNFAZ_AQyrMrEDrVfjU61X4\"/><figcaption>彭老太95歲，由兒子推輪椅走火警。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"火警期間現場冒出熊熊烈火。（讀者提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159060936519061504806539.jpeg/xAyoD7XupMMT4dzcBAJD5toIVIcSqlyxwnSu48J0ruM\"/><figcaption>火警期間現場冒出熊熊烈火。（讀者提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"火警期間現場冒出熊熊烈火。（讀者提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159060940067573760732108.jpeg/8dPO267DCM0l3uvz_OqyhfOGxjjJAXxuu_jQrLv40Kw\"/><figcaption>火警期間現場冒出熊熊烈火。（讀者提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"火警期間現場冒出熊熊烈火。（讀者提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159060943515422720026958.jpeg/bvlqGVVZlur6OXCIsyF1w6-ALFZqMfA14tBl7uLQZe4\"/><figcaption>火警期間現場冒出熊熊烈火。（讀者提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"火警熄滅後仍然冒出白煙。（陳巧恩攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159057010294263808954801.jpeg/oiXkUJQKQaTAuULWyCW5k7wHy755dBCj6lEoVMBRKFQ\"/><figcaption>火警熄滅後仍然冒出白煙。（陳巧恩攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"居民在村口登記資料。（陳巧恩攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159057007957905408208437.jpeg/EYtkZXhkxZHKW22zonfkrDJi639pe1U7DSldNScpXTU\"/><figcaption>居民在村口登記資料。（陳巧恩攝）</figcaption></figure><p>火警發生於今日（29日）凌晨4時31分，靈山村一間鐵皮屋起火。消防員到場出動一條喉和一隊煙帽隊灌救，約49分鐘後將火救熄；其間36男42女，與及一批貓狗疏散到安全地方。至清晨6時26分，警方指，一名男子被發現當場不治，警方正調查死者身份及致死原因。</p><figure><img alt=\"現場火光熊熊。（Facebook群組「北區之友 Friends of North District (上水、粉嶺、沙頭角和打鼓嶺)」影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159037248671453184759283.jpeg/zdNlxhiTtC4zjqxVgwf6GS35EOM__3tPdJKNiHSSjYg\"/><figcaption>現場火光熊熊。（Facebook群組「北區之友 Friends of North District (上水、粉嶺、沙頭角和打鼓嶺)」影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防員在場灌救。（Facebook「北區之友 Friends of North District (上水、粉嶺、沙頭角和打鼓嶺)」影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159040227310833664372514.jpeg/6dTETl_OX7yWOP7e5HZHboIBzxQ6cyTOmoSzBpqEswY\"/><figcaption>消防員在場灌救。（Facebook「北區之友 Friends of North District (上水、粉嶺、沙頭角和打鼓嶺)」影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防員在場灌救。（Facebook「北區之友 Friends of North District (上水、粉嶺、沙頭角和打鼓嶺)」影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159040229634609152216840.jpeg/WD4AElrhWk3_vQy_VB6LdWT_cboiBys7pi81_6YvNf8\"/><figcaption>消防員在場灌救。（Facebook「北區之友 Friends of North District (上水、粉嶺、沙頭角和打鼓嶺)」影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防員救出一隻貓。（陳巧恩攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159049909794508800680315.jpeg/IFEnGnk5dRGqcCtoLM9qfcAkIVOhvbA84OtB-srrQfo\"/><figcaption>消防員救出一隻貓。（陳巧恩攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"有寵物獲救。（陳巧恩攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159049330259136512021587.jpeg/dcY0LlD0w9DrKqI6j_KfhcTtBcBcFGqJf810I1XNdCM\"/><figcaption>有寵物獲救。（陳巧恩攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場仍然冒出白煙。（陳巧恩攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159048723960172544634287.jpeg/zPFgnnb4cOZ0xVyORggOa4771JKa8KM0nNS1i7bUtYs\"/><figcaption>現場仍然冒出白煙。（陳巧恩攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場仍然冒出白煙。（陳巧恩攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159048726145536000518604.jpeg/7j4VkvzmcOnx70FKrpHbVU5ZJ1LztCQ_NcjY6x_I2Os\"/><figcaption>現場仍然冒出白煙。（陳巧恩攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"居民疏散到路德會社區服務處休息。（彭紹殷攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159063254442446848702569.jpeg/VWNt6f6BKoYoF0wxJnMpmt8B0auizQct1KqaOtSqmjo\"/><figcaption>居民疏散到路德會社區服務處休息。（彭紹殷攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-29T04:39:25.464979+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":899,"images":19,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}